{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>A Mission of Revelation and Salvation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otherworld Chronicles</strong>\u00a0is a Lovecraftian game centered on narrative and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into a cursed and forgotten world. The gods have fallen, civilizations lie in ruins, and conflicts between races and families continue to shape the land \u2014 while its true history has long been buried by time and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrusted with a mission, you will gather and organize surviving texts, clues, and ruins, preserving the traces this world has left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Otherworld Chronicles</strong>, you will discover that<br><strong>to understand this world is, in itself, the first step toward salvation.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/55e2776806b695693fe45463365f986a.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experience</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f3 <strong>Narrative-driven text adventure exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >l\u00a0Explore a 2D world map where story progression is driven by text-based encounters. Each area holds fragments of memory and clues that lead you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/7192e6d6ee0457f02a60f77e7e47fc63.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Investigation-focused narrative puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > l\u00a0Uncover hidden histories and mysteries by reading, interpreting, and connecting narrative fragments scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/cb31e63288e95c0b50c1bc8c4d5480b5.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/a621a3a5b499dd8ef4597bc4cdce4354.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1560 height=875 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f\u00a0<strong>Combat encounters and optional side quests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >l\u00a0Certain locations may trigger combat encounters or side stories. These moments add tension and consequence to exploration, without shifting focus away from narrative discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/b8ad7f0459dff83c2c6bf89607821c00.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Light character progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >l\u00a0Earn attribute points through main and side quests to strengthen your character, opening up new possibilities during exploration and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/27bfdea2c0ffa381f28ac6b6a5d38091.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff9\u00a0<strong>Weapon collection and combat use</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >l\u00a0Weapons discovered during exploration can be equipped and used in battle, offering practical tools to confront the dangers hidden within this cursed world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/9b792a1d42eb134d9ff488fdafe8bf8c.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdd<strong>Before You Begin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherworld Chronicles emphasizes narrative and puzzle-solving over fast-paced action or combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are seeking quick reflex challenges or constant rewards, this may not be the right experience for you.<br>If you enjoy uncovering hidden histories and immersing yourself in a carefully constructed world, this journey may be worth taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/436ef66857f9f2bcffaefe50ec2e5ede.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619460?t=1772082793","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/86d7ee8ffa48c79c099ca210469def1dd4bcc01e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772082793","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/de664ecb9f2a444e791ebc47764f5eb883f4ac91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772082793","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/de664ecb9f2a444e791ebc47764f5eb883f4ac91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772082793","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f <strong>A Mission of Revelation and Salvation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Otherworld Chronicles</strong>\u00a0is a Lovecraftian game centered on narrative and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into a cursed and forgotten world. The gods have fallen, civilizations lie in ruins, and conflicts between races and families continue to shape the land \u2014 while its true history has long been buried by time and power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Entrusted with a mission, you will gather and organize surviving texts, clues, and ruins, preserving the traces this world has left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Otherworld Chronicles</strong>, you will discover that<br><strong>to understand this world is, in itself, the first step toward salvation.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/55e2776806b695693fe45463365f986a.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experience</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f3 <strong>Narrative-driven text adventure exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >l\u00a0Explore a 2D world map where story progression is driven by text-based encounters. Each area holds fragments of memory and clues that lead you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/7192e6d6ee0457f02a60f77e7e47fc63.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Investigation-focused narrative puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > l\u00a0Uncover hidden histories and mysteries by reading, interpreting, and connecting narrative fragments scattered throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/cb31e63288e95c0b50c1bc8c4d5480b5.avif?t