878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdd<strong>Before You Begin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherworld Chronicles emphasizes narrative and puzzle-solving over fast-paced action or combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are seeking quick reflex challenges or constant rewards, this may not be the right experience for you.<br>If you enjoy uncovering hidden histories and immersing yourself in a carefully constructed world, this journey may be worth taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/extras/436ef66857f9f2bcffaefe50ec2e5ede.avif?t=1772082793\" width=1536 height=1024 /></span></p>","developers":["Black Planet Studios"],"ext_user_account_notice":"EEGAMES (Supports Linking to Steam Account)","genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619460/cba349d292882e9e6c4c65bd0fb0da44e92a679f/header.jpg?t=1772082793","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619460/2008341433/a736cb03d36e992f0b3a9abd19ca0c388246612b/1756712915/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756718573","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619460/2008341433/a736cb03d36e992f0b3a9abd19ca0c388246612b/1756712915/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756718573","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/361946